{"5011730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Girlfriend Simulator", "steam_appid": 5011730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5011730/extras/26a71d0821e00997cdc4a9d53ab25723.poster.avif?t=1787361683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5011730/extras/26a71d0821e00997cdc4a9d53ab25723.webm?t=1787361683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5011730/extras/26a71d0821e00997cdc4a9d53ab25723.mp4?t=1787361683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's get ready for the day together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5011730/extras/b0e443c192ad7caa19a50e012ff83812.poster.avif?t=1787361683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5011730/extras/b0e443c192ad7caa19a50e012ff83812.webm?t=1787361683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5011730/extras/b0e443c192ad7caa19a50e012ff83812.mp4?t=1787361683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What should we do today? Let's cook some food!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5011730/extras/d5b8853059d2613fcd41f491bb5c65bd.poster.avif?t=1787361683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st