s=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I have to tell you something I've been meaning to say.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Listen, your world is uncontrollable, unpredictable, and full of suffering. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It can fill up your cup, then, once you've had a good taste... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pour everything completely out. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It'll even go as far as shattering the cup's glass while it's at it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control, predictability, and no suffering. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In my world I fill the cup, and glue your shards back together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My world is better, don't you agree?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Um... That was weird... Anyways, ready for bed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Full Plot with many Unexpected Twists and Turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Endings and 1 Secret Ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Video Games you could play, One of them having 5 Levels, a Final Boss Battle, and Gambling! (no real money)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <i>spooky moments</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking! but Don't Burn the House Down...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization! For the Player, and the Girlfriend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darts! Basketball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dates!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ob